{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41851","headline":"思简寂观旧游寄重道者 · 李中","name":"思简寂观旧游寄重道者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲忆当年游物外，羽人曾许驻仙乡。\n溪头烘药烟霞暖，花下围棊日月长。\n偷摘蟠桃思曼倩，化成蝴蝶学蒙庄。\n俗缘未断归浮世，空望林泉意欲狂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41851.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41851","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}